{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026h97uZINAT01794463123.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本出現今季首宗禽流感疫情，當局將撲殺20萬隻雞。</p><p></p><p>農林水產省表示，基因檢測結果確認，京都府龜岡市一個家禽飼養場的雞，感染高致病性H5禽流感病毒。當局預計殺雞行動需時一周，又將飼養場周邊半徑3公里以內劃為「移動限制區」，周邊半徑3至10公里劃為「搬出限制區」。</p><p></p><p>首相官邸召開禽流感相關會議。內閣官房長官木原稔表示，希望養雞戶徹底做好衞生管理，並與各都道府縣合作，採取萬全措施應對。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:23:50.799658+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T04:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T05:09:31.308309+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:17:16.060476+00:00","content_hash":"67727e7316fd99551c96ec3959c6ac851e461da4b2943eff63b19d265afce7f7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:23:50.799658+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}